The original compositor, xdg-shell, seat/data-device, move-grab and resize-grab
scaffolding has been retained and modified. The Ember-specific configuration,
window policy, workspace support, draw-terminal handling, rendering/theme,
control socket, wallpaper artwork and developer tooling were added in 2026.

The built-in Ember Panel Mono is a renamed subset of DejaVu Sans Mono,
distributed under the Bitstream
Vera / DejaVu font terms in assets/fonts/LICENSE-DejaVu. DejaVu changes are in
the public domain. Font source: https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/
